  UC PROGRAMS JAN-82
RAYLEIGH:
A) EQUILIBRIUM:
	PLRDR1.LD	read plates
	PLRDR2.LD	<TOVER1,TRHS,STAGE,TSTEP,TSCAN9 reads up to 4
			channels of data, but is slow.
B) VELOCITY:
	FPROG.LD	same as EPROG.LD but output can be used by
			SEDCF.LD for s & D.
SCANNER:
A)SEDIMENTATION EQUILIBRIUM:
	UCMPX.LD	get scans for most purposes; collects 2nd points
		of data.
	UCSCAN.LD	use when not a multiplexer operation or if you
		want every possible data point.
	SPROG.LD	corresponds to DATED.LD of rayleigh system
	SLOPD.LD	corresponds to a low speed equil program.
	SCEXFD.LD	fits sums of exponentials plus baseline
		(1-May-84).
	UCFILL.F4	cell filling schedule for multichannel, multi-
		sample experiments.
	MERGSC.F4	merge outputs of several SLOPD files.
	AVSCOP.F4	(AVRGW SUBR) average merged scanner files.
B) SEDIMENTATION VELOCITY:
	GETSCN.LD	get multiplexed (or not) velocity experiments.
	EQSCN.LD	Equivalent boundary (moving boundary).
	ACTENZ.LD	Active enzyme sed vel.
	SEDAE.LD	Get s from o.p. of ACTENZ.
	SEDCF.LD	The (optional) output of EQSCN is used for
			sedimentation coefficient calcns.
end
